  "description": "Soft scrambled eggs with wilted spinach and tomato, served with a thin flour round toasted in the same pan.",
  "iconKey": "crosshair",
  "instructions": [
    "Stir the flour into a soft dough, then press it into a thin round.",
    "Toast the round in a dry skillet over medium heat until it blisters, about 2 minutes per side, then set it aside.",
